{"name":"Mimimarked Superior","size":"medium","type":"aberration","tag":"","alignment":"evil","hitDice":"10","armorName":"none","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":5,"otherArmorDesc":"15","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"17 (5d8 - 5)","speedDesc":"5m","strPoints":"18","dexPoints":"12","conPoints":"10","intPoints":"14","wisPoints":"4","chaPoints":"6","blindsight":"90","blind":true,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1/2","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Mimicry","desc":"The [MON] can mimic 3 sounds it has heard. A creature that hears the sounds can tell they are imitations with a successful DC 15 Wisdom (Insight) check."},{"name":"Poisoned Touch","desc":"Whenever the [MON] hits a creature, it can inflict poison ([INT ATK] to hit, cd 10). The target takes [INT 1D4] poison damage on its next turn."}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The [MON] makes two attacks."},{"name":"Punch","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 1m, double target. _Hit:_ [STR 1D8] bludgeoning damage."},{"name":"Pustule","desc":"The monster can launch one of its pustules (max 3 simultaneously) to cause one of the following effects:\n- The pustule hits a target. The target is subjected to its Poisoned Touch trait until the pustule falls off (detach DC 9).\n- The pustule transforms into a mimimarked.\n- The pustule releases a greenish smoke in a 2m radius cloud. If the target is inside it at the start of its turn, it takes [INT 1D4] poison damage."}],"bonusActions":[],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"str","order":0}],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"bludgeoning","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"},{"name":"poison","note":" (Immune)","type":"i"}],"specialdamage":[{"name":"heal (x4)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"},{"name":"radiant (x2)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"conditions":[{"name":"blinded"},{"name":"deafened"},{"name":"poisoned"},{"name":"prone"},{"name":"stunned"}],"languages":[{"name":"Common","speaks":false}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"mimimarked superior","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":0,"damage":[]}